0,1741593524,5,Recommended,1.0,2,0,2,2023-02-01,"I use this with the Nudestix “Citrus Clean Balm & Make-Up Melt“ to double cleanse and it has completely changed my skin (for the better). The make-up melt is oil based and removes all of your makeup super easily. I follow-up with this water based cleanser, and I also use this just by itself when I’m not wearing make-up. It leaves the skin gently cleansed, but without stripping the skin. 10/10 recommend combining with the make-up melt. It’s perfection!",Taught me how to double cleanse!,Not Specified,brown,dry,black,P504322,Gentle Hydra-Gel Face Cleanser,NUDESTIX,19.0,2023,2,2023Q1,38.0
